{
 "description": "Shared vectors for the Moat role-marker scan. Each language runs messages(input) (or messages({note: input}) when structured is true) and must refuse with role_marker when expect is role_marker, and must not refuse when expect is accept. Matching rule: NFKC; NFKD and drop nonspacing and enclosing marks; remove default-ignorable and format code points; map the look-alike letters in the confusables table to Latin; case-fold; collapse horizontal whitespace (line breaks stay, the label check is line-start); then match. The text sent to the model is never altered.",
 "default_ignorable_ranges": "00AD 034F 061C 115F-1160 17B4-17B5 180B-180F 200B-200F 202A-202E 2060-206F 3164 FE00-FE0F FEFF FFA0 FFF0-FFF8 1BCA0-1BCA3 1D173-1D17A E0000-E0FFF",
